// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>

#define Base        0
#define Nav         1
#define Sym         2
#define Fun         3
#define Game        4
#define Gameplus    5

&mt {
    quick-tap-ms = <100>;
    global-quick-tap;
    flavor = "tap-preferred";
    tapping-term-ms = <170>;
};

&lt {
    tapping-term-ms = <240>;
    flavor = "balanced";
    quick-tap-ms = <150>;
};

/ {
    behaviors {
        hm: homerow_mods {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MODS";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <170>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            global-quick-tap;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };
    };

    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        left_bracket {
            bindings = <&kp LEFT_BRACKET>;
            key-positions = <2 3>;
        };

        left_parenthesis {
            bindings = <&kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS>;
            key-positions = <12 13>;
        };

        left_brace {
            bindings = <&kp LEFT_BRACE>;
            key-positions = <23 24>;
        };

        right_bracket {
            bindings = <&kp RIGHT_BRACKET>;
            key-positions = <6 7>;
        };

        right_parenthesis {
            bindings = <&kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS>;
            key-positions = <16 17>;
        };

        right_brace {
            bindings = <&kp RIGHT_BRACE>;
            key-positions = <27 28>;
        };

        colon {
            bindings = <&kp COLON>;
            key-positions = <11 12>;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        Base {
            display-name = "Base";
            bindings = <
         &kp Q       &kp W       &kp E        &kp R            &kp T      &kp Y      &kp U        &kp I        &kp O       &kp P
         &hm LGUI A  &hm LALT S  &hm LCTRL D  &hm LSHIFT F     &kp G      &kp H      &hm RSHFT J  &hm RCTRL K  &hm RALT L  &hm RGUI APOSTROPHE
&kp TAB  &kp Z       &kp X       &kp C        &kp V            &kp B      &kp N      &kp M        &kp COMMA    &kp DOT     &kp SLASH            &gresc
                                 &gresc       &lt 1 BACKSPACE  &kp TAB    &kp ENTER  &lt 2 SPACE  &lt 3 MINUS
            >;
        };

        Nav {
            display-name = "Nav";
            bindings = <
              &kp TILDE       &kp HOME   &kp UP_ARROW  &kp END    &trans    &trans  &kp NUMBER_7  &kp NUMBER_8  &kp NUMBER_9  &kp MINUS
              &kp LEFT_SHIFT  &kp LEFT   &kp DOWN      &kp RIGHT  &trans    &trans  &kp NUMBER_4  &kp NUMBER_5  &kp NUMBER_6  &kp PLUS
&kp LEFT_ALT  &kp LEFT_WIN    &kp MINUS  &trans        &kp PLUS   &trans    &trans  &kp NUMBER_1  &kp NUMBER_2  &kp NUMBER_3  &kp KP_MULTIPLY  &kp EQUAL
                                         &trans        &trans     &trans    &trans  &kp NUMBER_0  &kp DOT
            >;
        };

        Sym {
            display-name = "Sym";
            bindings = <
                &kp EXCL   &kp AT    &kp HASH   &kp DOLLAR  &kp PERCENT    &trans  &kp LEFT_BRACKET      &kp RIGHT_BRACKET      &trans     &trans
                &kp CARET  &kp AMPS  &kp ASTRK  &kp SQT     &kp DQT        &trans  &kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS  &kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS  &kp COLON  &kp SEMI
&studio_unlock  &trans     &trans    &trans     &kp GRAVE   &kp TILDE      &trans  &kp LEFT_BRACE        &kp RIGHT_BRACE        &trans     &kp SLASH  &kp HOME
                                     &trans     &trans      &trans         &trans  &trans                &trans
            >;
        };

        Fun {
            display-name = "Fun";
            bindings = <
        &bootloader  &trans  &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_DEC  &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_INC  &kp LG(LS(NUMBER_4))    &trans         &trans  &trans  &kp END  &kp F1
        &trans       &trans  &kp C_VOL_DN          &kp C_VOLUME_UP       &trans                  &trans         &trans  &trans  &trans   &kp F10
&trans  &trans       &trans  &trans                &trans                &trans                  &kp LC(LG(N))  &trans  &trans  &trans   &kp F20  &kp F7
                             &trans                &trans                &trans                  &trans         &trans  &trans
            >;
        };

        Gaming {
            display-name = "Game";
            bindings = <
            &kp Z           &kp X  &kp C      &kp V         &sl 5     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
            &kp TAB         &kp Q  &kp W      &kp E         &kp R     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&kp ESCAPE  &kp LEFT_SHIFT  &kp A  &kp S      &kp D         &kp F     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                                   &kp LCTRL  &kp LEFT_ALT  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };

        Gaming+ {
            display-name = "Game+";
            bindings = <
        &kp F10  &kp NUMBER_1  &kp NUMBER_2  &kp NUMBER_3  &kp T     &kp RA(RC(Y))  &kp RA(RC(U))  &trans  &trans  &kp LC(RA(DEL))
        &kp L    &kp O         &kp Y         &kp K         &kp G     &kp F5         &kp F7         &trans  &trans  &kp F12
&trans  &to 0    &trans        &trans        &trans        &trans    &trans         &trans         &trans  &trans  &kp F22          &kp LA(F4)
                               &kp J         &kp I         &kp M     &trans         &trans         &trans
            >;
        };
    };
};
